# Clarify target vial size

When the task affects **label layout, print/PDF/PNG output, label dimensions, typography on the label, QR/size on the label, export pipeline, or scaling of the label preview** — and the user has **not** stated which **vial size** they mean (**3 ml**, **10 ml**, or another supported profile once added) — **stop and ask** which vial size is in scope **before** implementing.

Use **vial size** in questions (not “label mm”) unless they already spoke in mm.

If they explicitly name the vial size or say “only what exists in code,” proceed without re-asking.
